[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.18,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Welcome back to \"Trails by the Experts.\"",
    "char_start": 16,
    "char_end": 56,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1.18,
    "end": 4.82,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Today, we're talking about trail construction, and I'm joined by Marco Bellini, a trail builder with the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 57,
    "char_end": 180,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 4.82,
    "end": 6.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Marco Bellini, thank you for being here.",
    "char_start": 181,
    "char_end": 221,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 6.0,
    "end": 7.11,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Thank you, Giulia.",
    "char_start": 237,
    "char_end": 255,
    "unit_id": "t0001.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0001.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 7.11,
    "end": 12.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "It's my pleasure – building trails is something I've given a lot of thought to.",
    "char_start": 256,
    "char_end": 335,
    "unit_id": "t0001.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0001.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 12.0,
    "end": 14.27,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "This episode is sponsored by Strava.",
    "char_start": 352,
    "char_end": 388,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 14.27,
    "end": 16.23,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Strava is the home of athletes.",
    "char_start": 389,
    "char_end": 420,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 16.23,
    "end": 18.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Start at strava.com/podcast.",
    "char_start": 421,
    "char_end": 449,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 18.0,
    "end": 21.04,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Tell me about how you made that decision.",
    "char_start": 450,
    "char_end": 491,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 21.04,
    "end": 24.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
    "char_start": 492,
    "char_end": 532,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s05"
  },
  {
    "start": 24.0,
    "end": 26.48,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Honestly, drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
    "char_start": 548,
    "char_end": 631,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 26.48,
    "end": 28.15,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 632,
    "char_end": 688,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 28.15,
    "end": 30.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 689,
    "char_end": 751,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 30.0,
    "end": 32.62,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Tell me how you came to that decision.",
    "char_start": 768,
    "char_end": 806,
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0004.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 32.62,
    "end": 36.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Which version of the question is truly important?",
    "char_start": 807,
    "char_end": 856,
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0004.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 36.0,
    "end": 39.68,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Yes, see – the most common mistake that beginner builders make is digging with a slope that is too steep.",
    "char_start": 872,
    "char_end": 977,
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0005.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 39.68,
    "end": 42.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 978,
    "char_end": 1044,
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0005.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 42.0,
    "end": 44.25,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "I want to delve deeper into this.",
    "char_start": 1061,
    "char_end": 1094,
    "unit_id": "t0006.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0006.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 44.25,
    "end": 48.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and trail construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 1095,
    "char_end": 1150,
    "unit_id": "t0006.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0006.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 48.0,
    "end": 48.29,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Certainly.",
    "char_start": 1166,
    "char_end": 1176,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 48.29,
    "end": 50.64,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Discussions about land management should take place before any excavation begins.",
    "char_start": 1177,
    "char_end": 1258,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 50.64,
    "end": 51.83,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "We've seen it on teams that use RockShox.",
    "char_start": 1259,
    "char_end": 1300,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 51.83,
    "end": 54.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "The frame is important because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
    "char_start": 1301,
    "char_end": 1376,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 54.0,
    "end": 60.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Tell me more.",
    "char_start": 1393,
    "char_end": 1406,
    "unit_id": "t0008.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0008.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 60.0,
    "end": 66.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within their workflow, the benefits become apparent – if you ignore them, you end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 1422,
    "char_end": 1598,
    "unit_id": "t0009.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0009.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 66.0,
    "end": 68.29,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Tell me how you made the decision.",
    "char_start": 1615,
    "char_end": 1649,
    "unit_id": "t0010.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0010.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 68.29,
    "end": 72.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and trail construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 1650,
    "char_end": 1705,
    "unit_id": "t0010.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0010.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 72.0,
    "end": 72.3,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Certainly.",
    "char_start": 1721,
    "char_end": 1731,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 72.3,
    "end": 73.75,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Cutting switchbacks into slopes is not optional.",
    "char_start": 1732,
    "char_end": 1780,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 73.75,
    "end": 75.86,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "The shortcut of the first day becomes the landslide of the third year.",
    "char_start": 1781,
    "char_end": 1851,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 75.86,
    "end": 78.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
    "char_start": 1852,
    "char_end": 1923,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 78.0,
    "end": 79.97,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "It's a helpful framework.",
    "char_start": 1940,
    "char_end": 1965,
    "unit_id": "t0012.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0012.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 79.97,
    "end": 84.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What is the most important aspect of this question?",
    "char_start": 1966,
    "char_end": 2017,
    "unit_id": "t0012.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0012.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 84.0,
    "end": 86.34,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Yes, look – the structure of the soil matters more than people realize.",
    "char_start": 2033,
    "char_end": 2104,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 86.34,
    "end": 87.96,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
    "char_start": 2105,
    "char_end": 2154,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 87.96,
    "end": 90.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "I've observed this pattern repeating in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 2155,
    "char_end": 2217,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 90.0,
    "end": 91.97,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What is the nature of the malfunction?",
    "char_start": 2234,
    "char_end": 2272,
    "unit_id": "t0014.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0014.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 91.97,
    "end": 96.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What is the underlying structural aspect that most listeners are not aware of?",
    "char_start": 2273,
    "char_end": 2351,
    "unit_id": "t0014.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0014.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 96.0,
    "end": 97.2,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Let me give you my honest opinion.",
    "char_start": 2367,
    "char_end": 2401,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 97.2,
    "end": 99.81,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "I've changed my mind about machine-made trails versus hand-crafted trails.",
    "char_start": 2402,
    "char_end": 2476,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 99.81,
    "end": 102.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 2477,
    "char_end": 2539,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 102.0,
    "end": 108.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Tell me more.",
    "char_start": 2556,
    "char_end": 2569,
    "unit_id": "t0016.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0016.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 108.0,
    "end": 114.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "And when teams adopt the Cascadia Alliance in that process, the trade-off becomes apparent – if you ignore it, you end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 2585,
    "char_end": 2762,
    "unit_id": "t0017.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0017.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 114.0,
    "end": 120.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "We'll be right back after a short commercial break.",
    "char_start": 2779,
    "char_end": 2830,
    "unit_id": "t0018.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0018.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 120.0,
    "end": 121.35,
    "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
    "text": "Today's episode is sponsored by Stripe.",
    "char_start": 2843,
    "char_end": 2882,
    "unit_id": "t0019.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0019.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 121.35,
    "end": 124.54,
    "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
    "text": "Stripe makes payments easy, whether you're running a marketplace or a subscription business.",
    "char_start": 2883,
    "char_end": 2975,
    "unit_id": "t0019.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0019.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 124.54,
    "end": 126.0,
    "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
    "text": "Visit stripe.com/podcast for a free trial.",
    "char_start": 2976,
    "char_end": 3018,
    "unit_id": "t0019.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0019.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 126.0,
    "end": 127.32,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Welcome back to the show.",
    "char_start": 3035,
    "char_end": 3060,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 127.32,
    "end": 129.11,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "How does the fault mechanism work?",
    "char_start": 3061,
    "char_end": 3095,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 129.11,
    "end": 132.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and trail construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 3096,
    "char_end": 3151,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 132.0,
    "end": 132.52,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "That's how I see it.",
    "char_start": 3167,
    "char_end": 3187,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 132.52,
    "end": 134.42,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
    "char_start": 3188,
    "char_end": 3261,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 134.42,
    "end": 135.74,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "We've seen it in teams that use Shimano components.",
    "char_start": 3262,
    "char_end": 3313,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 135.74,
    "end": 138.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "If you ignore it, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 3314,
    "char_end": 3401,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 138.0,
    "end": 140.92,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Tell me how you came to that decision.",
    "char_start": 3418,
    "char_end": 3456,
    "unit_id": "t0022.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0022.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 140.92,
    "end": 144.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
    "char_start": 3457,
    "char_end": 3497,
    "unit_id": "t0022.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0022.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 144.0,
    "end": 147.66,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Yes, see – the most common mistake that novice builders make is digging with a slope that is too steep.",
    "char_start": 3513,
    "char_end": 3616,
    "unit_id": "t0023.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0023.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 147.66,
    "end": 150.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 3617,
    "char_end": 3683,
    "unit_id": "t0023.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0023.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 150.0,
    "end": 151.87,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Challenge my conventional wisdom.",
    "char_start": 3700,
    "char_end": 3733,
    "unit_id": "t0024.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0024.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 151.87,
    "end": 156.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What were your previous beliefs on this topic, and how have they changed?",
    "char_start": 3734,
    "char_end": 3807,
    "unit_id": "t0024.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0024.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 156.0,
    "end": 156.95,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Let me give you my honest opinion.",
    "char_start": 3823,
    "char_end": 3857,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 156.95,
    "end": 159.21,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Discussions about land management should take place before any excavation begins.",
    "char_start": 3858,
    "char_end": 3939,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 159.21,
    "end": 160.27,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "We've seen teams using Spoke & Wrench.",
    "char_start": 3940,
    "char_end": 3978,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 160.27,
    "end": 162.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "I've observed this pattern repeating in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 3979,
    "char_end": 4041,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 162.0,
    "end": 168.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Quadra.",
    "char_start": 4058,
    "char_end": 4065,
    "unit_id": "t0026.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0026.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 168.0,
    "end": 171.86,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Outside of the tools provided by the Cascadia Alliance framework, identifying the root cause of the problem can be more challenging.",
    "char_start": 4081,
    "char_end": 4213,
    "unit_id": "t0027.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0027.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 171.86,
    "end": 174.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "And the second-order effects are the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
    "char_start": 4214,
    "char_end": 4287,
    "unit_id": "t0027.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0027.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 174.0,
    "end": 177.19,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What is the heuristic that you always find yourself using?",
    "char_start": 4304,
    "char_end": 4362,
    "unit_id": "t0028.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0028.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 177.19,
    "end": 180.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What is the most important aspect of this question?",
    "char_start": 4363,
    "char_end": 4414,
    "unit_id": "t0028.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0028.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 180.0,
    "end": 181.97,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "It boils down to this: cutting corners on slopes is not optional.",
    "char_start": 4430,
    "char_end": 4495,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 181.97,
    "end": 184.12,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "The shortcut on the first day leads to the landslide on the third year.",
    "char_start": 4496,
    "char_end": 4567,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 184.12,
    "end": 186.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 4568,
    "char_end": 4630,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 186.0,
    "end": 188.9,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What is the typical process for dealing with a malfunction?",
    "char_start": 4647,
    "char_end": 4706,
    "unit_id": "t0030.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0030.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 188.9,
    "end": 192.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What is the most often overlooked aspect of trail construction?",
    "char_start": 4707,
    "char_end": 4770,
    "unit_id": "t0030.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0030.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 192.0,
    "end": 193.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Let me give you my honest opinion.",
    "char_start": 4786,
    "char_end": 4820,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 193.0,
    "end": 194.55,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Soil structure is more important than people realize.",
    "char_start": 4821,
    "char_end": 4874,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 194.55,
    "end": 196.19,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 4875,
    "char_end": 4931,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 196.19,
    "end": 198.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "I've observed this pattern repeating in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 4932,
    "char_end": 4994,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 198.0,
    "end": 200.75,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "I want to delve deeper into this.",
    "char_start": 5011,
    "char_end": 5044,
    "unit_id": "t0032.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0032.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 200.75,
    "end": 204.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "How does Shimano fit into this picture?",
    "char_start": 5045,
    "char_end": 5084,
    "unit_id": "t0032.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0032.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 204.0,
    "end": 207.34,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Yes, look – I've changed my mind about machine-made trails versus hand-made trails.",
    "char_start": 5100,
    "char_end": 5183,
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0033.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 207.34,
    "end": 210.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 5184,
    "char_end": 5250,
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0033.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 210.0,
    "end": 216.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Where does it stop working?",
    "char_start": 5267,
    "char_end": 5294,
    "unit_id": "t0034.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0034.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 216.0,
    "end": 219.53,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Outside of the diagnostic tools provided by RockShox, it can be more difficult to identify the cause of the problem.",
    "char_start": 5310,
    "char_end": 5426,
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0035.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 219.53,
    "end": 222.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the troubleshooting process becomes easier.",
    "char_start": 5427,
    "char_end": 5508,
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0035.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 222.0,
    "end": 228.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Let's change the subject – I want to dedicate the final part to the management of the territory.",
    "char_start": 5525,
    "char_end": 5621,
    "unit_id": "t0036.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0036.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 228.0,
    "end": 234.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "That's where the conversation becomes truly interesting, because the compromises involved in managing the territory touch upon everything we've discussed.",
    "char_start": 5637,
    "char_end": 5791,
    "unit_id": "t0037.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0037.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 234.0,
    "end": 235.45,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "I want to delve deeper.",
    "char_start": 5808,
    "char_end": 5831,
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0038.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 235.45,
    "end": 240.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What is the opposing viewpoint that most listeners don't have access to?",
    "char_start": 5832,
    "char_end": 5904,
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0038.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 240.0,
    "end": 242.41,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "It boils down to this: drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
    "char_start": 5920,
    "char_end": 6016,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 242.41,
    "end": 243.82,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "We've seen it happen with teams using RockShox products.",
    "char_start": 6017,
    "char_end": 6073,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 243.82,
    "end": 246.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "If you ignore it, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 6074,
    "char_end": 6161,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 246.0,
    "end": 248.9,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What is the typical process for dealing with a malfunction?",
    "char_start": 6178,
    "char_end": 6237,
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0040.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 248.9,
    "end": 252.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "What is the most often overlooked aspect of trail construction?",
    "char_start": 6238,
    "char_end": 6301,
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0040.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 252.0,
    "end": 255.26,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Honestly, the most common mistake that novice builders make is digging with a slope that is too steep.",
    "char_start": 6317,
    "char_end": 6419,
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0041.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 255.26,
    "end": 258.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "The overall picture is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
    "char_start": 6420,
    "char_end": 6506,
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0041.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 258.0,
    "end": 264.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Before we wrap up, what's one thing listeners can try out this week?",
    "char_start": 6523,
    "char_end": 6591,
    "unit_id": "t0042.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0042.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 264.0,
    "end": 268.21,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
    "char_start": 6607,
    "char_end": 6675,
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0043.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 268.21,
    "end": 270.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Everything else is iteration.",
    "char_start": 6676,
    "char_end": 6705,
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0043.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 270.0,
    "end": 272.1,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "And finally, a big thank you to our partners at Linear.",
    "char_start": 6722,
    "char_end": 6777,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 272.1,
    "end": 274.97,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Linear is the ticketing system designed for speed – built for the keyboard.",
    "char_start": 6778,
    "char_end": 6853,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 274.97,
    "end": 276.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Check it out at linear.com.",
    "char_start": 6854,
    "char_end": 6881,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 276.0,
    "end": 282.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "Marco Bellini, thank you for the conversation.",
    "char_start": 6882,
    "char_end": 6928,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 282.0,
    "end": 288.0,
    "speaker_label": "Marco Bellini",
    "text": "Thank you, Giulia.",
    "char_start": 6944,
    "char_end": 6962,
    "unit_id": "t0045.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0045.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 288.0,
    "end": 292.46,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "That's all for today's episode of \"Author's Trails.\"",
    "char_start": 6979,
    "char_end": 7031,
    "unit_id": "t0046.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0046.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 292.46,
    "end": 294.0,
    "speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
    "text": "See you next time.",
    "char_start": 7032,
    "char_end": 7050,
    "unit_id": "t0046.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0046.s02"
  }
]
